          "name": "MarioKart 64: Recompiled 0.9.2",
          "tag_name": "v0.9.2",
          "description": "> [!WARNING]\n> If your antivirus software flags the game, it is a false positive. Builds downloaded from this page are always going to be safe.\n\n### Changelog\n- Reduced glitches related to Matrix Interpolation.\n- Fixed a performance issue in Kalimari Desert caused by incorrect usage of decals from the train.\n- The game will now adjust the HUD's aspect ratio according to the option picked in the options menu.\n- Eliminated flickering caused by interpolation during camera cuts.\n- Controller Pak support, now you can save your ghosts!\n- Audio channel swap has been fixed.\n\n### Modding & HD Texture Pack support\n- Mod support! Check out the [modding template](https://github.com/sonicdcer/MK64RecompModTemplate).\n- Compatible with [MK Reloaded](https://evilgames.eu/texture-packs/mk64-reloaded.htm#rt64) (HD Texture Pack). Thanks to @GhostlyDark for the help!\n  - To install the texture pack, go [here](https://evilgames.eu/texture-packs/mk64-reloaded.htm#rt64) and click the **RTZ** button under **Recomp** (the golden cup) to download it. \n  - Install the texture pack by launching the game, going into the mods menu and dropping the file on top of the game window or using the **Install Mods** button.\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> Support for configuring multiple controller ports is currently in development for N64 Recompilations. For that reason, only Single Player modes are available at the moment. Multiplayer modes will be accessible once the UI for multiple controllers is finished.\n\n> [!NOTE]  \n> **Intel GPU users:** Using outdated Intel drivers may cause the game to crash or cause graphical glitches. Please make sure your drivers are up-to-date before playing.\n>\n> [Intel HD 11th+ Gen/Intel Arc/Iris Xe](https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/download/785597/intel-arc-iris-xe-graphics-windows.html)\n> [Intel HD 7th-10th Gen](https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/download/776137/intel-7th-10th-gen-processor-graphics-windows.html)\n> [Intel HD 6th Gen](https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/download/762755/intel-6th-10th-gen-processor-graphics-windows.html)\n>\n> Do not use your operating system or driver suite to check for driver updates, sometimes these updates are not distributed by vendors. Always check Intel's website for the latest drivers.\n",
